+        <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to use browser AI summarization. You can still read the full journal above.</p></noscript>
+        <div id="journal-summary" class="journal-summary" aria-labelledby="summary-heading" hidden>
+          <h3 id="summary-heading">Sourcing at a glance</h3>
